Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.74,0:00:26.51,MV - Hanzi,,0,0,0,,喜欢你的微笑 和调皮的嘴角
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.74,0:00:26.51,MV - Pinyin,,0,0,0,,xǐhuān nǐ de wéixiào hé tiáopí de zuǐjiǎo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.74,0:00:26.51,MV - English,,0,0,0,,I like your smile and your mischievous little smirk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:31.55,MV - Hanzi,,0,0,0,,那午后的阳光 穿过你的发梢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:31.55,MV - Pinyin,,0,0,0,,nà wǔhòu de yángguāng chuānguò nǐ de fà shāo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:31.55,MV - English,,0,0,0,,And how the afternoon sunlight shines through the tips of your hair
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.79,0:00:36.56,MV - Hanzi,,0,0,0,,想让全世界 停在这一秒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.79,0:00:36.56,MV - Pinyin,,0,0,0,,xiǎng ràng quán shìjiè tíng zài zhè yī miǎo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.79,0:00:36.56,MV - English,,0,0,0,,When I'm with you, I forget the whole world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:41.33,MV - Hanzi,,0,0,0,,陪着你把世界都忘掉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:41.33,MV - Pinyin,,0,0,0,,péizhe nǐ bǎ shìjiè dōu wàngdiào
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:41.33,MV - English,,0,0,0,,The world fades from my mind when I'm with you
